# Force LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout under the common `core.autocrlf=true` converts LF to CRLF,
# and Biome's format check (which expects LF) then fails on the windows-latest CI leg only.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Conformance vectors are byte-exact by design: PB-1/PB-2 make payload bytes normative, and the
# corpus deliberately includes CRLF and no-trailing-newline cases. Never let git rewrite them.
packages/core/vectors/**    -text
*.tgz         binary
